@baseUrl = http://localhost:8096
@jellyfinToken = replace-with-a-valid-jellyfin-access-token
@requestId = replace-with-a-request-guid

### Get current user capabilities (admin flag)
GET {{baseUrl}}/MovieRequests/capabilities
X-Emby-Token: {{jellyfinToken}}

### Search TMDb movies
GET {{baseUrl}}/MovieRequests/search?query=Arrival
X-Emby-Token: {{jellyfinToken}}

### List requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/MovieRequests/list

### Submit a request
POST {{baseUrl}}/MovieRequests/request
Content-Type: application/json
X-Emby-Token: {{jellyfinToken}}

{
  "tmDbId": 329865
}

### Vote for a request as the authenticated Jellyfin user
POST {{baseUrl}}/MovieRequests/vote/{{requestId}}
X-Emby-Token: {{jellyfinToken}}

### Retrieve a single request (used by the create response Location)
GET {{baseUrl}}/MovieRequests/{{requestId}}

### Mark a request as completed (administrator only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/MovieRequests/request/{{requestId}}/completed
X-Emby-Token: {{jellyfinToken}}

### Delete a request (administrator only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/MovieRequests/request/{{requestId}}
X-Emby-Token: {{jellyfinToken}}
